PASADHI is derived from SUAY (https://github.com/camponggogo/suay), MIT licensed.

The control-plane design, the measurement harness conventions and the MIT licence text originate there.
PASADHI replaces the AI-only framing with a general matrix-compute plane and adds the multi-layer
process runtime and the old-hardware kernel strategy.

